---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Free 1-1 Careers Advice | EA Durham"
	description="Learn about free online 1-1 career advising services from 80,000 Hours, read EA Durham graduates' reviews, and get help applying."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main
		class="relative min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center bg-fixed bg-no-repeat"
		style="background-image: url('/assets/shared/page-hero-bg.jpg');"
	>
		<!-- Semi-transparent cream overlay to align with the EA brand theme and ensure readability -->
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#f4efe9]/85 backdrop-blur-[2px]"></div>

		<!-- Content container -->
		<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px] px-5 py-16 md:py-24">
			<!-- Page Title -->
			<div class="text-center mb-12">
				<h1
					class="font-ea-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal tracking-[0.25em] text-[#054d5a] uppercase mb-4"
				>
					Free 1-1 Careers Advice
				</h1>
				<div class="mx-auto h-[3px] w-24 bg-[#0c869b] mb-6"></div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 1: Intro Grid (Two Columns) -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start mb-16">
				<!-- Text Column -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8"
					>
						<p
							class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-4 font-bold"
						>
							Career planning is really hard, (and for me, quite scary!) but
							80,000 hours offer free online 1-1 career advice.
						</p>
						<p
							class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-4"
						>
							I (Alex Vellins) have spoken to them twice and found them to be
							friendly, incredibly knowledgeable and very focused on impact.
						</p>
						<p
							class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-2 font-semibold"
						>
							For me, the only limitation is that it's on you to take action on
							the resources they provide; so don't expect to leave with a full
							career plan, rather, expect to leave with:
						</p>

						<ul
							class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] space-y-2 mb-6 list-disc list-inside pl-2"
						>
							<li>Useful research questions and alternative framings</li>
							<li>A great variety of useful resources</li>
							<li>Options that you wouldn't have previously considered</li>
							<li>
								And possibly connections to people working in your cause area!
							</li>
						</ul>

						<p class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040]">
							Most people overestimate the amount of preparation required to
							apply to 80,000 hours, so if you're not sure, please apply! We
							expect that doing something like our Arete fellowship will be
							sufficient, but if you've thought deeply about the worlds problems
							and what you can do to tackle them, we'd be excited for you to
							apply!
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
						<a
							href="/arete-fellowship"
							class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[54px] px-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
							style="background-color: #68246d;"
							onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
							onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
						>
							ARETE FELLOWSHIP
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://80000hours.org/speak-with-us/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[54px] px-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-[#68246d] border-2 border-[#68246d] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#68246d]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]"
						>
							APPLY FOR ADVISING!
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Book Image Column -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-4 flex justify-center">
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"
					>
						<img
							src="/assets/free-careers-advice/80Kbook-twobooks-whitebkg-scaled-e1693395630953.jpg"
							alt="80,000 Hours Books"
							class="w-full max-w-[280px] lg:max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg object-cover"
						/>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3: Testimonials Block -->
			<div class="mb-16">
				<h2
					class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] tracking-wide mb-8 uppercase text-center"
				>
					Still not sure? Here's what two EA Durham Graduates have to say about
					the service:
				</h2>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
					<!-- Iyngkarran Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 flex-shrink-0">
							<img
								src="/assets/free-careers-advice/Iyngkarran.jpeg"
								alt="Iyngkarran"
								class="w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-[#e8dfd3]"
							/>
						</div>

						<div
							class="bg-[#054d5a] text-[#f4efe9] rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold font-ea-body tracking-wide mb-6 shadow-sm"
						>
							Iyngkarran, researcher at the Transformative Futures Institute
						</div>

						<div
							class="relative bg-[#f4efe9]/60 rounded-lg p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e8dfd3] text-left"
						>
							<span
								class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-4xl text-[#0c869b]/20 font-serif"
								>“</span
							>
							<div
								class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] italic relative z-10 px-2 space-y-4"
							>
								<p class="font-semibold">
									Some benefits and limitations of 80k advising from my personal
									experience:
								</p>
								<p>
									<strong>Benefits:</strong><br />
									- If you've not thought deeply about career planning before, 80k
									advising is a great call. They can introduce you to opportunities
									and even cause areas that you've never heard of before, and suggest
									concrete steps to start exploring them.<br />
									- Even if you've thought long and hard about career plans, 80k
									have a huge network of contacts that you can benefit from. They
									can introduce you to new contacts and help build your own network
									in the field.
								</p>
								<p>
									<strong>Limitations:</strong><br />
									- At the end of the day it's one 60-minute phone call, so the onus
									to take action on the things discussed in the meeting is on you.
									The 80k advisors only have time to check in and see how things
									are going every few months.<br />
									- If you've thought long and hard about your career the advising
									will be less useful, because 80k will be able to recommend fewer
									organisations and opportunities that you've not heard of. That
									being said, there is still a lot of value from making connections,
									see above.<br />
									- This goes without saying but prepare for the meeting beforehand,
									or else you'll miss out on a lot of potential value. I'd recommend
									something like 2hrs spent on 80k's preparatory doc before the meeting.
								</p>
							</div>
							<span
								class="absolute bottom-2 right-2 text-4xl text-[#0c869b]/20 font-serif"
								>”</span
							>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Sam Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 flex-shrink-0">
							<img
								src="/assets/free-careers-advice/Sam A.jpeg"
								alt="Sam"
								class="w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-[#e8dfd3]"
							/>
						</div>

						<div
							class="bg-[#054d5a] text-[#f4efe9] rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold font-ea-body tracking-wide mb-6 shadow-sm"
						>
							Sam in his Durham glory!
						</div>

						<div
							class="relative bg-[#f4efe9]/60 rounded-lg p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e8dfd3] text-left"
						>
							<span
								class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-4xl text-[#0c869b]/20 font-serif"
								>“</span
							>
							<p
								class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] italic relative z-10 px-2"
							>
								I was really impressed, and quite honestly surprised, about how
								insightful the 80K advisory session was. Huon, the advisor I
								booked a session with, helped me reframe job hunting and opened
								my eyes to career paths and opportunities I had not previously
								considered. Whether you're just starting your degree or coming
								to the end of it, I'd definitely recommend making the most of
								this free, actionable, and valuable service.
							</p>
							<span
								class="absolute bottom-2 right-2 text-4xl text-[#0c869b]/20 font-serif"
								>”</span
							>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4: Alex Vellins Bottom Card -->
			<div
				class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30"
			>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0">
						<img
							src="/assets/free-careers-advice/Alex V.png"
							alt="Alex Vellins"
							class="w-[160px] h-[210px] object-cover rounded-lg shadow-sm border-2 border-[#e8dfd3]"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1 text-center md:text-left">
						<p
							class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-8 font-semibold"
						>
							Want help applying? Book in a chat with me, Alex Vellins,
							(co-president of EA Durham). There is no application form and no
							preparation needed. I can talk you through the opportunities
							available and help you formulate your answers to the questions in
							the 80,000 hours application.
						</p>
						<div class="flex justify-center md:justify-start">
							<a
								href="https://calendly.com/alexvellins/hello"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer noopener"
								class="group inline-flex h-[54px] px-8 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
								style="background-color: #68246d;"
								onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
								onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
							>
								<span>SPEAK TO ALEX :D</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Layout>
